                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \array{E &amp;\to&amp; E_{\mathbf{\Pi}}\\ \downarrow &amp;&amp; \downarrow \\ \Sigma &amp;\to&amp; \mathbf{\Pi}(\Sigma)}
            to produce a
